    "description": "When you use a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mine\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mine\">Mine</a> or other fixed (non-<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grenade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grenade\">Grenade</a>) <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Explosive\">Explosive</a>, you can choose to have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Explosive\">Explosive</a> become <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Difficult_Terrain\" title=\"Difficult Terrain\">Difficult Terrain</a> after the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Explosive\">Explosive</a> has detonated. Alternatively, if you plant a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mine\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mine\">Mine</a> or fixed <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Explosive\">Explosive</a> in an area of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Difficult_Terrain\" title=\"Difficult Terrain\">Difficult Terrain</a>, you can have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Explosive\">Explosive</a> deal no damage and instead turn the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Difficult_Terrain\" title=\"Difficult Terrain\">Difficult Terrain</a> into normal terrain.",
